  "question": "Within 50 kilometers, where can I find a gallery aligned with the route to Safari West, Sant Rosa, CA from the St. Regis San Francisco, San Francisco, CA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.401381 37.786057)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.695392 38.557332)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'gallery'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.401381 37.786057)',4326)::geography, 50000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.401381 37.786057)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
